<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-12176] .NET: Apache.Ignite.exe fails when config has custom logger or plugins</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-12176</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Steps to reproduce:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Implement Apache.Ignite.Core.Log.ILogger interface, compiled into assembly&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Create a config file with that logger:
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
&amp;lt;configuration&amp;gt;
    &amp;lt;configSections&amp;gt;
        &amp;lt;section name=&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;igniteConfiguration&quot;&lt;/span&gt; type=&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;Apache.Ignite.Core.IgniteConfigurationSection, Apache.Ignite.Core&quot;&lt;/span&gt; /&amp;gt;
    &amp;lt;/configSections&amp;gt;

    &amp;lt;igniteConfiguration xmlns=&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;http:&lt;span class=&quot;code-comment&quot;&gt;//ignite.apache.org/schema/dotnet/IgniteConfigurationSection&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;gt;
&lt;/span&gt;        &amp;lt;logger type=&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&apos;CustomNs.CustomLogger, CustomAsm&apos;&lt;/span&gt; /&amp;gt;
    &amp;lt;/igniteConfiguration&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;/configuration&amp;gt;
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Run Apache.Ignite.exe with that config file while CustomAsm is in a separate dir:
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
Apache.Ignite.exe -ConfigFileName=myconfig.xml -assembly=c:\w\CustomAsm.dll
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</description>
